(E) catch-up: a flow cost Lsub*(1-s)^2 of standing below the top (concave value of standing; r=4, Gamma=0.3/0.6).
    The price formula (3) is then not the whole price (the flow term adds its own slope), so only r_eq is compared:
  Lsub=0.0 Gamma=0.3: r_eq/r=1.176 r_pr/r=1.088 Geq=0.353 e1(.25)=0.0113 e2(.25)=0.0122 (laggard gives up)
